+| Artifact | Observed hash |
+|---|---|
+| Stage 1 pipeline tree | `616879fa4fac0e0efd8499dbe2f4ff825c06468cdf0ed0d58cccf91ae600c27c` |
+| Stage 1 Klean export tree | `08cef3f0ee823df2acdd572e8ba6729d4736aec5c38e389fc8f19a3d6ae204ff` |
